{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f55a7a93-ab2c-8713-9221-cdc4b8dc5524",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T12:09:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisa Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:04:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Marisa Spencer. I am calling about water that is collecting at the curb in front of my building, at 404 Washington Street, in The Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:05:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 404 Washington. Is this from the rain, or what's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it has not rained. It has been dry for days. The snow banks are melting in the afternoon sun, and the water runs down and pools at the curb. It does not seem to go anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's meltwater just sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Then overnight it freezes, and by the morning there is a sheet of black ice across the edge of the street and onto the sidewalk. Somebody is going to slip on it. Kindly make a note of that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:06:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is it a storm drain right there that looks blocked, or is there no drain at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:06:31-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a drain near the corner of the curb, but I cannot say whether it is blocked. The water sits well back from it, and the grate looks to have some leaves and gravel packed around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:06:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And has this happened before, or is it new?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:06:59-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A neighbor told me it happens every big rain. I only mention it because I have not seen it myself in this weather until now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:07:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful. So it's a known low spot. How big an area is the ice, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:07:25-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perhaps six or eight feet along the curb, and a few feet out into the road. [pause] Forgive me, there is a terrible noise next door. The neighbor's teenager is learning the trumpet, and he is doing it very badly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:07:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear a little of that. Sounds like he's got a ways to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:07:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Indeed he does. Where was I? Yes, the ice extends into the road, and cars are driving through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:08:08-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I'll put in a work order for the crew to look at the drain and the pooling at 404 Washington, and flag the ice as a hazard so it gets looked at sooner. They may sand it or clear the grate, depending on what they find."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:08:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be most appreciated. Would it be possible for someone to telephone me when it has been taken care of?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:08:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:08:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0196, and it's Marisa Spencer, S-P-E-N-C-E-R?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:08:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. You'll get a call once the crew has been out and closed it. If it gets worse before then, or someone's hurt, call us back or dial 911 for an emergency."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:09:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I will do that. Good afternoon to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T12:09:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Marisa. Bye now."
    }
  ],
